{% comment %}
  Wraps every "SUF-CPT" in the nowrap span, so the hyphenated mark never breaks
  across two lines.

  In Liquid rather than in the copy because richtext settings permit NO
  attributes -- `<span class="...">` is rejected by template validation, so a
  merchant cannot type it even if they wanted to.

  Usage, on already-escaped or already-HTML text:
    {% render 'suf-nb', text: section.settings.heading %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign nb = '<span class="suf-nb">SUF-CPT</span>' -%}
{{- text | replace: 'SUF-CPT', nb -}}
